pyossia (2.0.0-rc6+124+cuems3) bookworm; urgency=medium

  * Add native C++ OSC bundle support to osc_protocol
  * OSCDevice now sends true atomic OSC bundles (not separate messages)
  * OSCQueryDevice push_bundle() uses native protocol bundle support
  * Add push_bundle(std::span<const ossia::bundle_element>) to osc_protocol
  * DMX cues now sent as single OSC bundle with #bundle framing
  * Performance improvement: atomic network transmission for bundles

 -- ion <ion@stagelab.coop>  Mon, 16 Feb 2026 20:20:00 +0200

pyossia (2.0.0-rc6+124+cuems2) bookworm; urgency=medium

  * Add bundle support for OSC/OSCQuery protocols
  * Add Bundle Python bindings with simplified API (no recursion)
  * Add push_bundle() methods to OSCQueryDevice and OSCDevice
  * Bundle API: use bundle.append(param, value) directly
  * Fix bundle recursion errors - now production-ready
  * Support all value types including lists (DMX-compatible)
  * Fix missing midi_protocol constructor implementation

